      174.21,
      226.97,
      389.49,
      238.31
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE MONETARY LAW ACT (CHAPTER 422)",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      250.97,
      401.9,
      274.31
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      286.97,
      401.85,
      310.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Monetary Law(Amendment) Act, No. of 2014.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      322.97,
      401.88,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 6 of the Monetary Law Act (Chapter 422) ishereby amended by the substitution for the words \u201cwhichsum is hereby appropriated to the bank from the surplusassets of the Board of Commissioners of Currency.\u201d of thefollowing words:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      194.85,
      394.97,
      401.87,
      430.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201cwhich sum is hereby appropriated to the bank fromthe surplus assets of the Board of Commissioners ofCurrency:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      194.85,
      442.97,
      401.89,
      538.31
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, the Monetary Board mayfrom time to time, having regard to the viability andstability of the financial system of Sri Lanka and inthe interest of the national economy, with theconcurrence of the Minister to whom the subject ofFinance has been assigned, increase the capital ofthe Central Bank to an amount not exceeding fiftybillion rupees.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      550.97,
      401.9,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      323.71,
      451.29,
      361.58
    ],
    "text": "Amendmentof section 6of Chapter422.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
